        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 02",
        "title": "Expanded Movement Pathways",
        "text_1": "The enhanced cable system unlocks movement pathways that the standard RS02 — and every spring-based reformer — simply cannot reach. Additional cable anchor points, combined with the wider arm articulation, create new angles of pull that expand your exercise library beyond the conventional. Movements that require diagonal or rotational pathways — essential for functional training and advanced Pilates — become not just possible but fluid and controlled.",
        "text_2": "Traditional spring reformers are limited to vertical and slightly angled pull patterns determined by fixed spring attachment points. The RS02 PRO's 200+ movements include diagonal, rotational, and asymmetrical patterns that no spring reformer can replicate. For practitioners who have exhausted what a standard reformer offers, the PRO opens an entirely new movement vocabulary."
