        "text_2": "The standard RS02 offers 0–132° arm range. The Align-Pilates F3 ($1,999) has no adjustable arms at all. The Your Reformer ($2,795) similarly lacks strength training arms. The PRO's 145° range means it covers more exercise angles than any reformer in its price class."
