        "title": "Studio-Level Reformer Experience",
        "text_1": "The combination of enhanced cables, smooth carriage glide, and precise digital weight creates a reformer experience that rivals professional studio equipment. The feel underfoot — the way the carriage responds, the consistency of resistance through the full stroke, the silence of operation — is calibrated to satisfy instructors and advanced practitioners who can immediately tell the difference between quality equipment and compromise equipment.",
        "text_2": "The Balanced Body Allegro 2 (~$6,000+ AUD) is the studio standard, known for its 'Silent Glide' carriage. The RS02 PRO matches that smoothness while adding digital weight precision that the Allegro 2's spring system cannot offer — all at less than half the price. For instructors who need a home practice base, the PRO is the closest thing to a studio reformer with smart technology built in."
